  "title": "MUFG leads Viva Aerobus’s debut JOLCO",
  "summary": "New York, NY (June 29, 2026) — Mitsubishi UFJ Financial Group (MUFG), one of the world’s largest global financial groups, proudly announces a Japanese Operating Lease with Call Option (“JOLCO”) facility for Viva Aerobus (“Viva”), with Three i's Capital Co., Ltd. (“Three i’s Capital”). The transaction marks Viva’s first JOLCO and Three i's Capital’s first investment into an aircraft JOLCO.",
